{"id":"wb-6-529","name":"艺圃","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"艺圃","text":"艺圃，明代宅邸园林，位于中国江苏省苏州市姑苏区金阊街道阊门社区文衙弄5号。全园占地仅为五亩，以池水为中心，池岸低平。池北以建筑为主，池南以假山景观为主，园景开朗，风格质朴，较多地保存了明末清初建园时格局，是典型的文人园林。\n艺圃作为苏州园林的代表，2000年，增补为世界文化遗产——苏州古典园林项目。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%89%BA%E5%9C%83","revisionId":91611426,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91611426","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/fa765ffe131f64410c6e7258.jpg","title":"YiPu.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:YiPu.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/88/YiPu.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"张骐 (中文維基百科的Brookqi)","license":"Public domain","licenseUrl":"","caption":"​苏州园林－艺圃","width":320,"height":212}}